## 1. Executive Summary

Battle Pets Arena is a free-to-play online auto battler where players build teams of pets with unique abilities to compete against other players or AI opponents. The game features asynchronous multiplayer matchmaking, allowing players to hop in for quick matches at any time.

---

## 2. Game Overview

### 2.1 Core Loop

The game alternates between two phases:

1. **Shop Phase:** Players spend gold to buy pets, purchase food items, roll the shop, and arrange their team. Players have 10 gold per turn.
2. **Battle Phase:** Teams fight automatically. The rightmost pet attacks the opponent's leftmost pet. Combat continues until one team is eliminated.

### 2.2 Win Condition

- **Arena Mode:** Win 10 battles before losing all lives (start with 5 lives)
- **Versus Mode:** Be the last player standing in an 8-player lobby

### 2.3 Team Composition

- Maximum 5 pets per team
- Position matters: pets attack from right to left
- Combine 3 identical pets to level up (max level 3)

