## 4. Ability System

### 4.1 Ability Triggers

Abilities are activated by specific triggers during shop or battle phases.

#### Shop Phase Triggers

| Trigger | When It Fires |
|---------|---------------|
| `onBuy` | When this pet is purchased from the shop |
| `onSell` | When this pet is sold |
| `onLevelUp` | When this pet gains a level |
| `onFoodEaten` | When this pet consumes food |
| `startOfTurn` | At the beginning of each shop phase |
| `endOfTurn` | When player ends their shop phase |

#### Battle Phase Triggers

| Trigger | When It Fires |
|---------|---------------|
| `startOfBattle` | Before any attacks occur |
| `beforeAttack` | Just before this pet attacks |
| `onAttack` | When this pet performs an attack |
| `afterAttack` | Immediately after attacking |
| `onHurt` | When this pet takes damage |
| `onFaint` | When this pet's HP reaches 0 |
| `onFriendFaint` | When an allied pet faints |
| `onEnemyFaint` | When an enemy pet faints |
| `onKill` | When this pet's damage causes an enemy to faint |
| `onSummon` | When a new pet is summoned during battle |

