## 10. API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/game/start` | Start a new game session |
| GET | `/api/shop` | Get current shop contents |
| POST | `/api/shop/buy` | Purchase a pet or food item |
| POST | `/api/shop/roll` | Roll the shop (costs 1 gold) |
| POST | `/api/team/arrange` | Update team positions |
| POST | `/api/team/sell` | Sell a pet from team |
| POST | `/api/battle/ready` | End shop phase, enter matchmaking |
| GET | `/api/battle/result` | Get battle result and replay events |
| Realtime | `game:{game_id}` | Supabase Realtime channel for versus mode |
| Realtime | `matchmaking:{player_id}` | Supabase Realtime channel for match notifications |

