## Appendix: Glossary

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| ATK | Attack stat. Damage dealt when a pet attacks. |
| HP | Health points. Pet faints when this reaches 0. |
| Faint | When a pet's HP reaches 0 and it is removed from battle. |
| Summon | Adding a new pet to the team during battle (via ability). |
| Trigger | The event that causes an ability to activate. |
| Buff | Temporary or permanent stat increase. |
| MMR | Matchmaking Rating. Hidden skill score for pairing players. |
| Snapshot | Saved state of a player's team used for async battles. |
